{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CdVnCTiBKyCzkPqNavgZz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll help you get the Interceptor working again. After a Chrome reinstall, the extension was likely removed and needs to be re-added. Let me guide you through the setup.\n\nCan you check a few things:\n\n1. **Is the Interceptor extension installed in Chrome?** Go to `chrome://extensions/` — do you see \"Claude Code Interceptor\" listed there?\n\n2. **If it's there, is it enabled?** There should be a toggle switch that's on.\n\n3. **If it's not there**, we'll need to reinstall it. The extension should be bundled with Claude Code. You can typically add it by:\n   - Opening Chrome\n   - Going to `chrome://extensions/`\n   - Enabling \"Developer mode\" (toggle in top right)\n   - Looking for a \"Load unpacked\" button and pointing it to your Claude Code extension directory (varies by installation type — desktop app vs CLI vs web)\n\nWhat do you see when you check `chrome://extensions/`? If you're not sure where the extension files are located, let me know how you installed Claude Code (desktop app, VS Code extension, web app, etc.) and I can help you find them."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7043,"cache_read_input_tokens":17536,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7043},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"REDACTED","uuid":"36fb4c01-d462-4376-a017-c0e212f7d4b9","timestamp":"2026-07-29T05:15:59.830Z","request_id":"req_011CdVnCSP4fNMjXWdMPyT3i"}
